        "key": "SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_04_010",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_04:SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_04_010:7fb1db3b",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_04:SubEv_C09_Gilgamesh_04_010:7fb1db3b",
        "jp_sha256": "c3e7abe0d1236979e47e57ed9ab35419ddba02e3c762e25ee1e63f403040f360",
        "official_en_sha256": "b4403b9723fb15e3e43e678fedbf63c2ad9a873a562e41ca88527042138a8c93"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "「ぬすっと」とはなんだ！\r\nオレはいつも盗まれる側なんだぞ！\r\n言うならば、「ぬすまれっと」だっ！",
        "official_en": "What!? I’m the one people always steal from! If anything, I’m a two-bit <text style=\"italic\">victim</>! And who are you to call me “two-bit”? I’ve got way more bits than that—sixteen on a good day!",
        "real_en": "What do you mean, 'thief'?! I'm always the one getting robbed! If anything, you should call me a <text style=\"italic\">'robbee'</>!"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
