      "text": {
        "jp": "いいだろう、見せてやろう。\r\nオレのとっておきの必殺技をな！",
        "official_en": "Well, if you’re so eager to witness it, feast your eyes on this!",
        "real_en": "All right, I'll show you my special finishing move!"
