      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いいや！\r\nなんでも力で解決しようとは、けしからん！\r\nそんなやつは、オレの必殺技で返り討ちだ！",
        "official_en": "Using force to settle disagreements is never the answer! I shall strike down violent thugs such as yourselves with my ultimate attack!",
        "real_en": "No! Trying to solve everything with force is outrageous! I'll turn the tables on people like that with my ultimate attack!"
      },
